      "text": "Day 6 · Breakfast, then the Brazilian side of the falls, in a national park of unique flora and fauna. “Big water” in the Guaraní language, the falls are made up of some 275 cascades, each with its own name, plunging into the Devil’s Throat gorge: a spectacle you could contemplate for hours.",
