      "text": "Day 7 · Breakfast, then cross the Tancredo Neves Bridge for a tour of the Argentine side with an English-speaking guide. Here walkways lead directly above and below the falls, to the very edge of the Devil’s Throat. After the tour, transfer to the airport for your flight to Buenos Aires, and transfer with driver to the hotel.",
